(5.2). In this case, a rectified linear unit is the most popular choice for η ̄ and was used e.g. in
[43, 10, 21, 27], but other popular activation functions appear as well [37].
If however the input- and output feature maps transform in non-trivial representations of
G, η ̄ needs to satisfy
