output feature map can be decomposed into a direct sum of irreducible representations,
labeled by an integer `. The scalar transformations of (6.29) are N + 3 copies of the ` = 0
representation and the fundamental representation in (6.30) is the ` = 1 representation. To
decompose the similarity transformation in (6.31), we use the following
